---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { business } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | TC Decks Utah Deck Builder" description="How TC Decks collects, uses and protects the information you send through this website, including estimate requests and the deck planner.">
  <PageHero title="Privacy policy" />
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap prose">
    <p>TC Decks (Tippetts Construction) respects your privacy. This page explains what information this website collects, how we use it and the choices you have.</p>

    <h2>Information you send us</h2>
    <p>When you send an estimate request, we receive the name, phone, email, city and project details you enter. If you use the deck planner and send your sketch, we also receive the deck size, shape, materials and other choices you made. We use this information only to contact you about your project, answer your questions and prepare your estimate.</p>

    <h2>What we don't do</h2>
    <p>We don't sell, rent or trade your information. We don't add you to a mailing list unless you ask us to, and we only share details with others when it's needed to plan or build your project, such as ordering materials, or when the law requires it.</p>

    <h2>Information saved in your browser</h2>
    <p>The deck planner saves your sketch in your own browser so it's still there if you come back. It stays on your device until you send it to us, and you can clear it at any time by clearing your browser's site data.</p>

    <h2>Analytics and other sites</h2>
    <p>This site may use basic, privacy-friendly analytics to count visits and see which pages are useful. Links to other sites, such as Google, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube or our financing partner Wisetack, are covered by those companies' own privacy policies.</p>

    <h2>Keeping your information safe</h2>
    <p>This website is served over a secure, encrypted connection. Estimate requests are delivered to our business email, and we keep them only as long as we need them to serve you and keep normal business records.</p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>To ask what information we have about you, or to have it corrected or deleted, send us a message through our <a href="/contact">contact form</a> or call <a href={business.phoneHref}>{business.phone}</a>.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
